            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>id</code> sorgu parametresi adını, ardından eşittir işaretini <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>3</code> sayısını yazarak API'den kimliği <code>3</code> olan kursu iste.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"comment_feed.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>id=3</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
